#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Run live event analysis from the incident-scoped publication base.

The protected host checkout deliberately remains on the pre-transition commit.
This wrapper reads the root-controlled publication-base pin, proves that exact
commit against the local public-main ref, materializes only the analyzer's
runtime paths with ``git archive``, and never checks out or updates a Git ref.
"""

